    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d298-a2">

                <pb facs="0577" n="507" sameAs="frus:frus1883/pg507"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Lieutenant Doane to
                        Acting Assistant Adjutant-General Turner.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Fort Maginnis, Mont.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1883-05-12"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 12,
                        1883</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Four lodges Crees here; two more coming in; also twelve Crees captured by Steele
                    at mouth of Musselshell en route to post. Steele is after more. Ask orders.</p>
                <closer><signed>DOANE,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Lieutenant
                        Commanding.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
